      "settings": {
        "heading": "COLORFAST APPAREL\nEMBROIDERY AND SCREEN PRINT",
        "text": "<p>Our Custom Embroidery & Screen Print Program is designed to give brands, creatives, and teams an easy way to transform our blanks into fully customized garments. Using our premium blank styles as the foundation, we can apply custom embroidery and screen-printed graphics tailored to the look, feel, and direction of your project. Whether you're looking for a clean chest logo, oversized back graphic, detailed embroidery, multi-color artwork, or a combination of techniques, our program gives you the flexibility to create something that feels intentional and specific to your brand. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>By starting with an already-developed blank, you can focus on the artwork, placement, color, and finishing details without having to build a garment from the ground up. Our goal is to maintain the quality, construction, fit, and hand feel of the original piece while adding custom decoration that feels integrated into the garment rather than simply applied to it. From subtle branding and tonal embroidery to bold graphics and statement prints, each project can be developed around your creative direction. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>From small capsule collections and artist merchandise to brand uniforms, events, and larger production runs, our Custom Embroidery & Screen Print Program offers a flexible way to create elevated, production-ready pieces using blanks you already know and trust. With multiple decoration options, placements, and color possibilities available, the program makes it simple to take a blank garment and turn it into something completely your own.&nbsp;</p>",
